libimobiledevice
------------------------------------------
Cross-platform protocol library to communicate with iOS devices

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libimobiledevice-glue1.0-devel-1.3.3-1bl1
  libimobiledevice-glue1.0_0-1.3.3-1bl1
  libimobiledevice1.0-devel-1.4.0-1bl2
  libimobiledevice1.0_6-1.4.0-1bl2
  libplist2.0-devel-2.8.1-1bl1
  libplist2.0_12-2.8.1-1bl1
  libreadline8-8.3-1
  libssl-devel-3.5.9-1
  libssl3-3.5.9-1
  libtatsu0-1.1.0-1bl1
  libusbmuxd2.0-devel-2.1.1-1bl2
  libusbmuxd2.0_7-2.1.1-1bl2
  pkg-config-3.0.10-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  autoconf-20260320-3
  automake-20261107-1
  binutils-2.47-1
  cygport-0.37.12-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  libimobiledevice-glue1.0-devel-1.3.3-1bl1
  libplist2.0-devel-2.8.1-1bl1
  libreadline-devel-8.3-1
  libssl-devel-3.5.9-1
  libtatsu-devel-1.1.0-1bl1
  libtool-2.6.2-1
  libusbmuxd2.0-devel-2.1.1-1bl2
  make-4.4.1-2

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/libimobiledevice/libimobiledevice

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/libimobiledevice/libimobiledevice/archive/refs/tags/1.4.0.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack libimobiledevice-1.4.0-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./libimobiledevice-1.4.0-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/libimobiledevice-1.4.0-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libimobiledevice-1.4.0-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libimobiledevice1.0_6-1.4.0-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libimobiledevice1.0-devel-1.4.0-X.tar.xz

